  "worked_solution": "Let's examine our statement:\n\n- The word \"every\" indicates we should use a universal quantifier, $\u2200.$\n\n- The sentence refers to real numbers. So, by denoting a real number as $x,$ we have that \n\n$$\n\u2200\\,x\\in R.\n$$\n\n- Finally, the condition in the statement can be written as \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we write the statement as follows: \n\n$\u2200\\,x\\in R,\\,{x}^{2}\\ge 0.$",
